TI  - The Data Frontier for Large Language Models: Selection, Synthesis, and Tools
AU  - Wu, Lijun
AU  - Zhang, Wentao
AU  - He, Conghui
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/July
T2  - Proceedings of the 64th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (Volume 5: Tutorial Abstracts)
